<div id="Top"><h2>The Canticles</h2></div>
<p>A canticle (from the Latin canticulum, a diminutive of canticum, song) is a hymn
(strictly excluding the Psalms) taken from the Bible. The term is often expanded to include
ancient non-biblical hymns such as the Te Deum and certain psalms used liturgically.
 (<a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canticle" target="_blank">Wikipedia</a>)</p>
